  "description": "This receipt is a thermal point-of-sale (POS) receipt issued by OH!SOME at the Lippo Plaza Kramat Jati branch, located on Jl. Raya Jakarta–Bogor KM 19, Kramat Jati, East Jakarta, Special Capital Region of Jakarta, Indonesia. The header displays the store branding, full branch address, receipt number, customer copy designation (Salinan pelanggan – Di toko), checkout timestamp, and cashier identifiers. The receipt includes a retail transaction section followed by a financial summary showing the number of products, Product Discount, Rounding, 11% Indonesian VAT (ID-11%), Total, Cash, and Change. The footer records the payment timestamp, print sequence, promotional message (\"MEET MY OHSOME DAY\"), return and exchange policy notice, and concludes with a \"Closed Bill\" status. This receipt represents a standard Indonesian retail POS receipt featuring transaction metadata, tax reporting, cash payment reconciliation, and customer service information in a compact thermal receipt format.",
